Staged because this repository's push credential cannot write .github/workflows (see the handoff).

Apply with: git apply docs/handoff/ci-evals-step.patch

Why: §5 of LAUNCH_READINESS.md is the AI regression gate, and `pnpm evals` is invoked by neither CI job,
so the golden-case suite is only ever run by hand. `scripts/release/evidence.ts` records that as the
gate's admitted limitation; this step removes it. The step belongs in the `infrastructure` job because the
evals need the database.

--- a/.github/workflows/verify.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/verify.yml
@@
       - name: Webhook to queue E2E
         run: pnpm test:e2e
+
+      # The AI regression gate (#60, LAUNCH_READINESS.md §5). Without this step the golden cases are only
+      # ever run by hand, which is what `scripts/release/evidence.ts` admits for that gate.
+      - name: AI golden cases
+        run: pnpm evals
